    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:avcapturecolorspaceapplelog2:0002:0001",
      "source": "The Apple Log 2 Color space, which uses Apple Gamut as the color primaries, and an Apple defined Log curve as a transfer function.",
      "ko": "Apple Gamut를 색의 원색으로 사용하고 Apple이 정의한 Log 곡선을 전달 함수로 사용하는 Apple Log 2 색공간입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "526ef4d97a9c128aa27d22754aa16e4c91d843b79627d4c044d4b28cf3d8076e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:avcapturecolorspaceapplelog2:0002:0002",
      "source": "When you set this as the active color space on an [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md), any [`AVCapturePhotoOutput`](avcapturephotooutput.md) or [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) connected to the same [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) is made inactive (its [`isActive`](avcaptureconnection/isactive.md) property returns `false`).",
      "ko": "이 색공간을 동일한 [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md)의 활성 색공간으로 설정하면, 같은 [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md)에 연결된 [`AVCapturePhotoOutput`](avcapturephotooutput.md) 또는 [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md)는 비활성 상태가 되며, 해당 [`isActive`](avcaptureconnection/isactive.md) 속성은 `false`를 반환합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c99873762b72d56c9fbf22afd3c72acf16554c9ac857da06e329ec43a045920d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
